  "body": "This is an exceptional and increasingly rare opportunity to secure approximately 1,300m² of flat, usable land in one of Orewa’s sought after coastal locations. Within easy walking distance of the beach and close to Orewa’s vibrant and evolving town centre, this substantial site offers serious potential.\r\n\r\nZoned Residential - Mixed Housing Urban, the generous landholding provides plenty of scope for its next chapter offering outstanding flexibility for a variety of potential uses.  The existing single level home and large garage with mezzanine require renovation, but the possibilities are there. For many, the value here lies not in the current dwelling, but in the sheer size, prime location, and future potential of the land.\r\n\r\nAdding further appeal is the Nukumea Stream at the bottom of the garden. There is even a little boat shed for the kayaks. Large, flat sections of this size and in this location are becoming increasingly hard to find. The vendor is committed to selling. See the potential?  Don't wait for someone else to see it first.",
